operation renderTodoRow
input operation renderTodoRow doneArray COpaqueMemoryAddress
input operation renderTodoRow titlesBuffer COpaqueMemoryAddress
input operation renderTodoRow actualIndex CSignedInt64
input operation renderTodoRow selectedIndex CSignedInt64
input operation renderTodoRow todoCount CSignedInt64
