purpose operation renderTodoRow "Render one visible table row from the heap-backed todo arrays."
invariant operation renderTodoRow "Rendering reads todo arrays but does not mutate todo state."
invariant operation renderTodoRow "todoRowFormatText's `%3lld` index column reserves three digits, which assumes todoCapacity <= 999. If todoCapacity grows past 999, the column will widen and the table borders in topFrameText/bottomFrameText/blankRowText will misalign. Update all four format constants in lockstep when bumping todoCapacity."
warning renderTodoRow "todoRowFormatText's `%-40.40s` title column silently truncates titles longer than 40 bytes to 40 bytes on screen. The underlying titlesArray slot is still titleCapacity bytes (currently 128); only the rendered display is clipped. Editing a truncated row in the modal shows the full underlying title, not the truncated form."
label startRenderTodoRow
storage local immutable oneValue CSignedInt64 1
storage local immutable doneFlagValue CSignedInt32 1
