purpose operation writeJsonEscapedStringBuffer "Write a title buffer as JSON string content with quote and backslash escaped."
invariant operation writeJsonEscapedStringBuffer "The loop reads until NUL and writes each source byte once, escaping quote and backslash before the byte reaches JSON."
label startWriteJsonEscapedStringBuffer
storage local immutable zeroIndex CSignedInt64 0
storage local immutable oneStep CSignedInt64 1
storage local immutable rawCharacterFormatText CNullTerminatedByteString "%c"
storage local immutable escapedQuoteText CNullTerminatedByteString "\\\""
storage local immutable escapedBackslashText CNullTerminatedByteString "\\\\"
storage local mutable readIndex CSignedInt64 zeroIndex
label writeJsonEscapedLoop
call loadTitleByteCall pointer.loadByte
argument loadTitleByteCall buffer COpaqueMemoryAddress titleBuffer
argument loadTitleByteCall offset CByteCount readIndex
run loadTitleByteCall
bind value titleByte CSignedInt32 loadTitleByteCall
call nulCheckCall math.equalCSignedInt32
argument nulCheckCall left CSignedInt32 titleByte
argument nulCheckCall right CSignedInt32 nulByte
run nulCheckCall
bind value titleByteIsNul Bool nulCheckCall
branch if condition titleByteIsNul target finishWriteJsonEscaped
call quoteCheckCall math.equalCSignedInt32
argument quoteCheckCall left CSignedInt32 titleByte
argument quoteCheckCall right CSignedInt32 quoteByte
run quoteCheckCall
bind value titleByteIsQuote Bool quoteCheckCall
branch if condition titleByteIsQuote target writeEscapedQuote
call backslashCheckCall math.equalCSignedInt32
argument backslashCheckCall left CSignedInt32 titleByte
argument backslashCheckCall right CSignedInt32 backslashByte
run backslashCheckCall
bind value titleByteIsBackslash Bool backslashCheckCall
branch if condition titleByteIsBackslash target writeEscapedBackslash
call writeRawCharacterCall c.fprintf
argument writeRawCharacterCall stream CFileHandle fileHandle
argument writeRawCharacterCall format CNullTerminatedByteString rawCharacterFormatText
argument writeRawCharacterCall character CSignedInt32 titleByte
run writeRawCharacterCall
bind value rawCharacterWriteResult CSignedInt32 writeRawCharacterCall
call rawCharacterWriteFailedCall isNegativeStatus
argument rawCharacterWriteFailedCall statusCode CSignedInt32 rawCharacterWriteResult
run rawCharacterWriteFailedCall
bind value rawCharacterWriteFailed Bool rawCharacterWriteFailedCall
branch if condition rawCharacterWriteFailed target returnJsonWriteFailed
branch else target advanceJsonEscapedLoop
label writeEscapedQuote
call writeEscapedQuoteCall c.fprintf
argument writeEscapedQuoteCall stream CFileHandle fileHandle
argument writeEscapedQuoteCall format CNullTerminatedByteString escapedQuoteText
run writeEscapedQuoteCall
bind value escapedQuoteWriteResult CSignedInt32 writeEscapedQuoteCall
call escapedQuoteWriteFailedCall isNegativeStatus
argument escapedQuoteWriteFailedCall statusCode CSignedInt32 escapedQuoteWriteResult
run escapedQuoteWriteFailedCall
bind value escapedQuoteWriteFailed Bool escapedQuoteWriteFailedCall
branch if condition escapedQuoteWriteFailed target returnJsonWriteFailed
branch else target advanceJsonEscapedLoop
label writeEscapedBackslash
call writeEscapedBackslashCall c.fprintf
argument writeEscapedBackslashCall stream CFileHandle fileHandle
argument writeEscapedBackslashCall format CNullTerminatedByteString escapedBackslashText
run writeEscapedBackslashCall
bind value escapedBackslashWriteResult CSignedInt32 writeEscapedBackslashCall
call escapedBackslashWriteFailedCall isNegativeStatus
argument escapedBackslashWriteFailedCall statusCode CSignedInt32 escapedBackslashWriteResult
run escapedBackslashWriteFailedCall
bind value escapedBackslashWriteFailed Bool escapedBackslashWriteFailedCall
branch if condition escapedBackslashWriteFailed target returnJsonWriteFailed
branch else target advanceJsonEscapedLoop
label advanceJsonEscapedLoop
call advanceReadIndexCall math.addI64
argument advanceReadIndexCall left I64 readIndex
argument advanceReadIndexCall right I64 oneStep
run advanceReadIndexCall
bind value nextReadIndex CSignedInt64 advanceReadIndexCall
set memory readIndex nextReadIndex
jump target writeJsonEscapedLoop
label finishWriteJsonEscaped
return value SaveSucceeded
label returnJsonWriteFailed
return value SaveWriteFailed

